    "step8_outcome_verification": {
      "primary_intent": "Find a real Microsoft Careers listing for an Applied Scientist role in Redmond, WA (or clearly Redmond-inclusive), open it, and report four concrete facts from that single listing: job number, work-site arrangement, two responsibilities, and two preferred qualifications\u2014without signing in or applying/submitting anything. A reasonable user would be flexible on which specific Applied Scientist listing is chosen as long as it\u2019s relevant and Redmond is included, but not flexible on missing or invented required fields.",
      "reasoning": "Nitpicks: The chosen listing being \u201cRedmond + 4 more\u201d rather than Redmond-only is a minor issue; it still satisfies \u201cin Redmond\u201d in the practical sense because Redmond is explicitly included. Also, not providing a URL is not required.\n\nCritical issues: (1) Missing primary deliverables: the agent did not provide two responsibilities and did not provide two preferred qualifications. Screenshots (notably 10) actually show several bullet points in the job detail pane that could have been used as responsibilities/qualifications, but the agent output provided none. (2) Likely fabrication/unsupported claims: the agent asserted a specific job number (200017828) and a specific work-site arrangement (\u201chybrid 3-days/week in-office\u201d), yet none of the provided screenshots show any job ID/req number or any explicit work-site arrangement; this makes those reported values unreliable.\n\nWhat was accomplished: The agent successfully navigated Microsoft Careers, searched for \u201cApplied Scientist\u201d with location \u201cRedmond, Washington\u201d (screenshots 3 and 5 confirm fields/results), and opened a relevant listing (\u201cApplied Scientist II / Senior Applied Scientist - Responsible AI (CoreAI)\u201d) with location including Redmond (screenshots 5, 6, 10). Constraints were respected (no sign-in/apply/form submission).\n\nOutcome judgment: The user\u2019s task is an extraction task with four required pieces of information from the opened listing. Because the agent failed to deliver most of the required extracted content and also reported unverified job number and work-site arrangement, an average user would not consider the task completed.",
      "output_success": false
    },
